# LaTeX intermediate artefacts — regenerable from report.tex / references.bib
# via `make pdf` (or `latexmk -pdf report.tex`).  Only the .tex source, the
# .bib, the figures/, the final report.pdf, and report.html are tracked.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.xdv
